{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1374857-dune-fan-conversion","id":1374857,"title":"Dune Fan Conversion","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-03-14T19:10:56-07:00","id":1374857,"title":"Dune Fan Conversion","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b>Dune Fan Conversion<br /> Storypath Trinity Continuum: AEON<br /> Introduction</b></span></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><b>I have no fear,<br /> for fear is the little death that kills me over and over.<br /> Without fear, I die but once.</b></span></span> </div> </div> </div> <div align=\"right\">-- mantra of the City of Introspection</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">I must not fear.<br /> Fear is the mind-killer.<br /> Fear is the little-death that brings total obliteration.<br /> I will face my fear.<br /> I will permit it to pass over me and through me.<br /> And when it has gone past I will turn the inner eye to see its path.<br /> Where the fear has gone there will be nothing. Only I will remain.</span></b></span> </div> </div> </div> <div align=\"right\">-- Dune Litany Against Fear</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Frank Herbert's Dune Universe and all things Dune is one of my favorite Scifi setting of all time. With the release of Storypath and Trinity Continuum Aeon my goal is a quick and easy Dune Fan Conversion.<br /> <br /> My parameters are to capture the flavor of the setting, change as little mechanics as possible but as much as needed.<br /> <br /> My current source material is:<ul><li>Chronicles of the Imperium Dune Core Game</li> <li>Dune: Legacy of Landsraad (Fan Supplement)</li> <li>All Dune Novels by Frank Herbert, Brian Herbert, Kevin J Anderson</li> </ul>I am open to feedback, colaboration and more references as we work through this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"> <hr /><b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Roleplaying</span> not <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Rollplaying</span> or <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Ruleplaying</span></span></b></div> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><u><b>Current</b> <b>Focus</b></u><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Storypath &amp; Storypath to Run CoD, VtR, WtF, MtA</span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Dungeons &amp; Dragons 5th Edition</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":25095,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","user":"Graylion","date":". 03-14-2020, 10:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","name":"Graylion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25095_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"368"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-14T19:13:59-07:00","id":1374858,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b>Dune Fan Conversion<br /> Storypath Trinity Continuum: AEON<br /> \u200bPaths</b></span></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>PATHS</b><br /> <br /> Conditioning Overlays = Origin Path or Role Path<br /> <br /> Allegiance, Allegiance Template and/or Factions = Society Path<br /> <br /> <b>FACTIONS</b><br /> <br /> Factions would be primarily for the characters society path, however they can be used in a variety of ways. The skill set of a Harkonnen assassin would be very different from a Harkonnen diplomat.<br /> <br /> Examples<br /> * Origin: Born Atreidas Caladan Noble<br /> * Role: Assassin to House Harkonnen<br /> * Society: Sister of Bene Gesserit School<br /> <br /> <b>Great Houses</b><br /> * House Atreides<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Athletics, Close Combat, Culture, Humanities </div> </div> </div>* House Corrino<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Aim/Firearms, Command, Culture, Humanities </div> </div> </div>* House Harkonnen<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Humanities, Larceny, </div> </div> </div>* House Moritani<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Culture, Humanities, Larceny </div> </div> </div>* House Tseida<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Humanities </div> </div> </div>* House Wallach<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Aim/Firearms, Close Combat, Pilot </div> </div> </div><b>Minor Houses</b><br /> <br /> <b>Great Schools</b><br /> * Bene Gesserit School<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Command, Empathy, Enigmans, Humanities </div> </div> </div>* Mentat School<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Enigmas, Humanities, Technology </div> </div> </div>* Suk Physicial School<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Enigmas, Humanities, Medicine </div> </div> </div>* Sword Master Academy<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Athletics, Close Combat, Survival </div> </div> </div><b>Other Factions</b><br /> * Bene Tleiax<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Humanities, Medicine, Science, Technology </div> </div> </div>* CHOAM<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Culture, Humanities </div> </div> </div>* Spacing Guild<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Humanities, Pilot, Science </div> </div> </div>* Fremen<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Athletics, Close Combat, Larceny, Survival </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"> <hr /><b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Roleplaying</span> not <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Rollplaying</span> or <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Ruleplaying</span></span></b></div> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><u><b>Current</b> <b>Focus</b></u><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Storypath &amp; Storypath to Run CoD, VtR, WtF, MtA</span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Dungeons &amp; Dragons 5th Edition</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":25095,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","user":"Graylion","date":". 03-14-2020, 10:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","name":"Graylion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25095_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"368"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-14T19:15:12-07:00","id":1374859,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b>Dune Fan Conversion<br /> Storypath Trinity Continuum: AEON<br /> \u200bSkills &amp; Attributes</b></span></div> <br /> SKILLS<br /> <br /> Aim/Firearms = Ranged Combat<br /> Athletics = Bows, Thrown<br /> Close Combat = Armed Combat, Unarmed Combat<br /> Command = Command, Leadership,<br /> Culture = Artistry, Culture, Gaming, Performance, Theology<br /> Empathy =<br /> Enigmas = Prescience, Prophesy, Ritualism,<br /> Humanities = Administration, Computation, Economics, History, Language, Law, Politics<br /> Larceny = Assassination, Concealment, Espionage, Impersonation, Racketeering, Sabatoge, Stealth, Subterfuge, Underworld<br /> Medicine= First Aid, Medical Arts, Pharmacy<br /> Persuasion = Bargaining, Charm, Diplomacy, Persuasion<br /> Science<br /> Survival<br /> Technology = Repair<br /> <br /> The more detailed Dune skills listed may act as Skill Specialialties.<br /> <br /> <br /> ATTRIBUTES<br /> <br /> Mental<br /> Logic = Intellect<br /> Reaction = Cunning<br /> Willpower = Resolve<br /> <br /> Physical<br /> Strength = Might<br /> Dexterity = Dexterity<br /> Constitution = Stamina<br /> <br /> Social<br /> Presence = Presence<br /> MA = Manipulation<br /> Perception* = Composure<br /> <br /> * Not a perfect fit but not bad","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"> <hr /><b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Roleplaying</span> not <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Rollplaying</span> or <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Ruleplaying</span></span></b></div> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><u><b>Current</b> <b>Focus</b></u><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Storypath &amp; Storypath to Run CoD, VtR, WtF, MtA</span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Dungeons &amp; Dragons 5th Edition</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":25095,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","user":"Graylion","date":". 03-14-2020, 10:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","name":"Graylion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25095_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"368"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-14T19:15:48-07:00","id":1374860,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b>Dune Fan Conversion<br /> Storypath Trinity Continuum: AEON<br /> \u200bMantras (Psi Powers)</b></span></div> <br /> MANTRAS<br /> <br /> Mental Mantras<br /> * Concentration (1-5)<br /> * Trance (1-5)<br /> * Heightened Senses (1-5)<br /> * Vocalize (1-5)<br /> <br /> Physical Mantras<br /> * Active Body Manipulation<br /> * Passive Body Manipulation<br /> * Face Dancing<br /> <br /> Prescience | Sight | Vision = Psi Powers","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"> <hr /><b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Roleplaying</span> not <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Rollplaying</span> or <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Ruleplaying</span></span></b></div> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><u><b>Current</b> <b>Focus</b></u><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Storypath &amp; Storypath to Run CoD, VtR, WtF, MtA</span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Dungeons &amp; Dragons 5th Edition</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":25095,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","user":"Graylion","date":". 03-14-2020, 10:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","name":"Graylion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25095_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"368"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-14T19:16:30-07:00","id":1374861,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b>Dune Fan Conversion<br /> Storypath Trinity Continuum: AEON<br /> \u200bThings</b></span></div> <br /> THINGS &amp; TECHNOLOGY PLACE HOLDER<br /> <br /> Spice Milange","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"> <hr /><b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Roleplaying</span> not <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Rollplaying</span> or <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Ruleplaying</span></span></b></div> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><u><b>Current</b> <b>Focus</b></u><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Storypath &amp; Storypath to Run CoD, VtR, WtF, MtA</span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Dungeons &amp; Dragons 5th Edition</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":25095,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","user":"Graylion","date":". 03-14-2020, 10:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","name":"Graylion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25095_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"368"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-14T19:17:38-07:00","id":1374862,"title":"","content":"PLACEHOLDER #1 FOR FUTURE CONTENT","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"> <hr /><b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Roleplaying</span> not <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Rollplaying</span> or <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Ruleplaying</span></span></b></div> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><u><b>Current</b> <b>Focus</b></u><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Storypath &amp; Storypath to Run CoD, VtR, WtF, MtA</span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Dungeons &amp; Dragons 5th Edition</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","name":"Graylion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25095_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"368"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-14T19:18:33-07:00","id":1374863,"title":"","content":"PLACEHOLDER #2 FOR FUTURE CONTENT","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"> <hr /><b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Roleplaying</span> not <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Rollplaying</span> or <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Ruleplaying</span></span></b></div> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><u><b>Current</b> <b>Focus</b></u><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Storypath &amp; Storypath to Run CoD, VtR, WtF, MtA</span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Dungeons &amp; Dragons 5th Edition</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","name":"Graylion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25095_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"368"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-14T19:19:35-07:00","id":1374864,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b>Dune Fan Conversion<br /> Storypath Trinity Continuum: AEON<br /> \u200bMisc</b></span></div> <br /> Misc<br /> <br /> If an item is not mentioned it is most likely a match in both name and function, for example;<br /> <br /> Attributes, Difficulty, Initiative, Round, Skills, Specialization, ...<br /> <br /> Other Terms<br /> * Advantages = Edges<br /> * Allegiance = Society Path<br /> * Conditioning Overlay = Paths<br /> * Development Points = XP<br /> * Disadvantages = Complications, Conditions, Fields<br /> * Dodge Skill = Defense<br /> * Drama Die = Not Used<br /> * Dramatic Failure = Botch<br /> * Dramatic Success = Stunts<br /> * Karma Points = Momentum<br /> * Level = Dots / Rank<br /> * Options = Actions<br /> * Renown = Fame Edge<br /> * Resistance = Defense<br /> * Wound Level = Health<br /> <br /> Tests<br /> * Combined Test = Teamwork<br /> * Extended Tests =<br /> * Opposed Test =<br /> * Skill Test =<br /> * Test Modifiers = Complications, Enhancements<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>TIERS</b><br /> * Tier 1<br /> * Tier 2<br /> * Tier 3","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"> <hr /><b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Roleplaying</span> not <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Rollplaying</span> or <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Ruleplaying</span></span></b></div> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><u><b>Current</b> <b>Focus</b></u><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Storypath &amp; Storypath to Run CoD, VtR, WtF, MtA</span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Dungeons &amp; Dragons 5th Edition</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":25095,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","user":"Graylion","date":". 03-14-2020, 10:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","name":"Graylion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25095_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"368"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-29T17:01:08-07:00","id":1377240,"title":"","content":"Just wanted to say that this is really cool and that I would be very interested in seeing how you would play either in Dune or a Dune-like setting. On that I would say that for me a campaign set previous to the events of Dune, which disrupts the whole Imperium, would be where I would want it to be set at, though I could also see people wanting it in the later periods as well.<br /> <br /> There is one thing I would definitely want in a Dune-like game, and that would be rules for playing one of the Great Houses of the Imperium. This could be done either as the group is a single House or it could be each player haivng their own Houses. Either way I totally would want there to be some way for more noble holding focused play to exist.<br /> <br /> But yeah, this is really cool and I look forward to seeing what develops from out of it in time.<br /> <br /> Oh, as a PS, I could see something like Dramatic Editing being similar to something like Drama Die (if its what I think it is, i need to check my pdf of Dune, sigh, I wish I had the Dune rpg in physical, ...) <br /> <br /> I would also say that I think some of the more mystical seeming things the characters do in Dune could easily be Gifts of Talents or the Powers of Superiors.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":661,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","user":"LordHeru","date":". 03-29-2020, 08:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-01T16:17:39-07:00","id":1377810,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1374857-dune-fan-conversion?p=1377240#post1377240\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just wanted to say that this is really cool and that I would be very interested in seeing how you would play either in Dune or a Dune-like setting. On that I would say that for me a campaign set previous to the events of Dune, which disrupts the whole Imperium, would be where I would want it to be set at, though I could also see people wanting it in the later periods as well.<br /> <br /> There is one thing I would definitely want in a Dune-like game, and that would be rules for playing one of the Great Houses of the Imperium. This could be done either as the group is a single House or it could be each player haivng their own Houses. Either way I totally would want there to be some way for more noble holding focused play to exist.<br /> <br /> But yeah, this is really cool and I look forward to seeing what develops from out of it in time.<br /> <br /> Oh, as a PS, I could see something like Dramatic Editing being similar to something like Drama Die (if its what I think it is, i need to check my pdf of Dune, sigh, I wish I had the Dune rpg in physical, ...) <br /> <br /> I would also say that I think some of the more mystical seeming things the characters do in Dune could easily be Gifts of Talents or the Powers of Superiors.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think at the end of the Butlerian Jihad, with the emergence of the great schools, the founding of CHOAM and such would be a great place to start a game.<br /> <br /> I think a cross between Trinity Core, Aeon, and Dystopia provides a great framework.<br /> <br /> I was going to mix up aptitudes and modes<br /> <br /> So navigators a bit of Clair and Port<br /> <br /> Sisters Telepathy and BioK for the body control<br /> The telepathic mind control would be tweaked to &quot;Voice&quot;<br /> <br /> Mentats Clair, ?<br /> <br /> Ginaz BioK, Legiion maybe<br /> <br /> Just some quick thoughts<br /> <br /> I'm guessing Talents and Superiors may work as well.<br /> <br /> The porters will be evolved with the space folding developed by Norrma.<br /> <br /> The spice would be the catalyst for psionic modes played down.<br /> <br /> Rogue pockets of thinking machines, butlerian movement on the rise destroying tech, Venport trying again corporate footholds, an emperor trying to prove the universe needs him. Flesh merchants, bam!<br /> <br /> Ya Dune is one of my favorite novels of all times.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"> <hr /><b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Roleplaying</span> not <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Rollplaying</span> or <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Ruleplaying</span></span></b></div> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><u><b>Current</b> <b>Focus</b></u><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Storypath &amp; Storypath to Run CoD, VtR, WtF, MtA</span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Dungeons &amp; Dragons 5th Edition</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":25095,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","user":"Graylion","date":". 04-01-2020, 07:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","name":"Graylion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25095_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"368"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}